text Naranja_IslaMellsweet_G14_M05_Text_0818D758 {
    "REVIVE is fantastic!\pGive it to a fainted POKéMON, and the\nPOKéMON will arise.\pBut be careful, REVIVE doesn’t restore\nthe used-up PP of moves."
}

text Naranja_IslaMellsweet_G14_M05_Text_0818D7E7 {
    "MAX REPEL keeps all weak POKéMON away.\pOut of all the REPEL sprays, it lasts\nthe longest."
}

text Naranja_IslaMellsweet_G14_M05_Text_0818D841 {
    "The NET and DIVE BALLS are rare POKé\nBALLS that are only made in MOSSDEEP.\pA NET BALL is effective against\nBUG-type and WATER-type POKéMON.\pA DIVE BALL works best on POKéMON at\nthe bottom of the sea."
}
